#
# One git-tracked script path per line, relative to the platform repo root.
# This file exists because CI checks out THIS repo only: without it the
# duplicate-script gate would find no platform tree and skip, which is the
# failure mode it was written to prevent. Do not hand-edit — regenerate with
#     scripts/validate-iac.sh --refresh-platform-inventory
# on a machine that has both checkouts. The gate FAILS if a live platform
# checkout is present and disagrees with this snapshot.
